          "kicker": "Attacking threat",
          "heading": "Immanuel Feyi-Waboso shines in freer Exeter role as Steve Borthwick watches on",
          "body": "The Exeter winger delivered a standout performance during Friday’s narrow 40-36 defeat to Bath, catching the eye of England head coach Steve Borthwick at the Recreation Ground. Feyi-Waboso excelled in a more liberated role, recording a game-high 132 metres and scoring two tries. While England teammate Henry Slade struggled from the tee, Feyi-Waboso’s \"video game stuff\" bolstered his standing as a core international starter. With the Australia fixture approaching, such clinical finishing remains vital for an England side seeking consistency."
