          "heading": "Michael Hooper faces sustained backlash over call to ban Andrea Piardi",
          "body": "The dispute regarding Michael Hooper’s demand for a World Rugby ban on Andrea Piardi remains unresolved today. Following Hooper’s public comments, Sir Steve Hansen has entered the debate, asserting that the former Wallabies captain’s perspective on refereeing standards holds merit. While reports across the rugby press continue to highlight the tension, World Rugby has issued no official response or update regarding future appointments for Piardi. The Azzurri, meanwhile, continue their own preparations for the upcoming Nations Championship fixtures."
