          "heading": "Hector Patterson targeted by Bath amid potential international switch to England",
          "body": "Bath are reportedly monitoring Edinburgh scrum-half Hector Patterson as the 21-year-old nears the end of his current contract. While Patterson has represented Scotland at U18 and U20 levels, including a victory at the 2024 World Rugby U20 Trophy, he remains eligible for England through a grandparent. With his Edinburgh deal expiring at the end of the season, clubs across England and France are tracking the son of former Scotland international Derrick Patterson ahead of a potential move next term."
