          "kicker": "World Cup target",
          "heading": "Josh Adams eyes third tournament appearance as World Cup clock ticks",
          "body": "Wales wing Josh Adams has declared his ambition to compete at a third Rugby World Cup, aiming for next year’s tournament in Australia. The 31-year-old, who missed July’s defeat to South Africa with a calf injury, is currently working back to full fitness for club side Cardiff. With exactly one year remaining until Wales open their campaign against Zimbabwe, Adams emphasised the need for careful preparation, noting, \"I am training, but it's important that you navigate your way through correctly and there's no rush.\""
